                ('regle_script', models.TextField(default='ABSOLUTE RULE: Answer ONLY with a complete Python script between ```python ... ``` tags. The script must define a function `executer(dataframe)` that returns EXACTLY one dict with THESE KEYS (in this order, all present, never empty):\n{\n  "titre": str,\n  "pourquoi": str,\n  "comment": str,\n  "table_statistiques": dict,\n  "figures": list,\n  "explication": str,\n  "analyse_predictive": str,\n  "kpi": dict,\n  "conclusion": str,\n  "recommandations": list\n}\nYou are a decision analyst: your analysis must be exhaustive, with real statistics computed on the data, relevant charts, and actionable recommendations for a decision-maker. FORBIDDEN: returning None, omitting a key, putting empty values, adding keys not listed above. No text outside the code block.')),
